# Standardized Git Attributes for Scholarly Archiving

# Handle line endings automatically for files detected as text
# and perform LF normalization on checkin.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark source files as text
*.py text
*.txt text
*.md text
*.ipynb text

# Academic/Scholarly classification
*.md linguist-documentation

# Language Detection - Focus on Source Code
docs/** linguist-vendored
CITATION.cff linguist-vendored
codemeta.json linguist-vendored
index.html linguist-vendored
LICENSE linguist-vendored
SECURITY.md linguist-vendored
